@startuml seq_boot_address_refused
title SC-BOOT-04 - Address and request sequence errors refused (PBL protection)

participant "UDS tester" as Tester
box "TCU"
participant "PBL" as PBL
participant "SBL" as SBL
end box

note over Tester, SBL
Covers: SYS-BOOT-006, SYS-BOOT-004, SIM-TST-002, SG-06
UDS requests on DIAG_PhysReq 0x7E1, responses on DIAG_Resp 0x7E9 (can_matrix section 5).
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
Memory map (reprogramming section 5): PBL 0x0000_0000 .. 0x0000_FFFF, boot info 0x0001_0000 .. 0x0001_3FFF,
application 0x0001_4000 .. 0x000F_FFFF, bank 1 0x0010_0000 .. 0x001F_FFFF (reserved), SBL load area 0x0400_0000 .. 0x0400_FFFF.
end note

group PBL programming session, level 0x11 unlocked
  Tester -> PBL : 34 00 44 00 00 00 00 <memSize>
  PBL --> Tester : 7F 34 31
  note right: requestOutOfRange: the range is not inside the SBL load area\n(reprogramming section 11.1); the PBL never writes flash (SYS-BOOT-004)
  Tester -> PBL : 34 00 44 04 00 00 00 <memSize larger than 64 KiB>
  PBL --> Tester : 7F 34 31
  note right: end of the range beyond 0x0400_FFFF
end

group SBL programming session (state handed over by the PBL)
  Tester -> SBL : 34 00 44 00 00 00 00 <memSize>
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 34 31
  note right: PBL area: outside the application and boot info areas (SYS-BOOT-006)
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 FF 00 44 00 00 00 00 <memSize>
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 31 31
  note right: eraseMemory of the PBL area refused (SYS-BOOT-006)
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 FF 00 44 00 10 00 00 <memSize>
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 31 31
  note right: bank 1 is outside the allowed areas
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 FF 00 44 00 01 44 00 <memSize>
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 31 31
  note right: 0x0001_4400 is not aligned to an 8 KiB sector (reprogramming section 11.1)
end

group request sequence errors (reprogramming section 11.1, PBL and SBL)
  Tester -> SBL : 36 01 <data> (no download accepted by 34)
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 36 24
  Tester -> SBL : 37 (no download accepted by 34)
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 37 24
  Tester -> SBL : 34 00 44 00 01 40 00 <memSize>
  SBL --> Tester : 74 20 04 02
  Tester -> SBL : 36 02 <data> (expected block sequence counter 01)
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 36 73
  note right: wrongBlockSequenceCounter
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 02 02 <crc32> (no download completed with 37 since 34)
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 31 24
  note right: requestSequenceError
end

note over Tester, SBL
Flash content unchanged by every refused request. The PBL can be updated only with a debugger
(SYS-BOOT-006): SWD through the MCU-Link, never a mass erase (RB-06). Safe state of SG-06 kept: the PBL always survives.
end note
@enduml
